msgstr "已忽略。保留用于工厂兼容性。"

#: ../../source/unit/cardkb2.rst
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "引发"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBI2C:7
msgid "If the CardKB unit is not found on the I2C bus."
msgstr "如果在 I2C 总线上未找到 CardKB 单元。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBI2C:11
msgid ""
"Do not instantiate this class directly. Use :class:`CardKBUnit` with "
"``mode=CardKBUnit.CardKB_I2C_MODE`` instead."
msgstr "不要直接实例化此类。请改用 :class:`CardKBUnit` 并设置 ``mode=CardKBUnit.CardKB_I2C_MODE``。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBI2C.get_firmware_version:1
msgid "Read the firmware version from the CardKB unit."
msgstr "从 CardKB 单元读取固件版本。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBI2C.get_firmware_version:3
msgid "The firmware version byte."
msgstr "固件版本字节。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBUART:1
msgid "CardKB unit driver over UART communication."
msgstr "基于 UART 通信的 CardKB 单元驱动程序。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBUART:3
msgid "The UART bus ID (0, 1, or 2). Defaults to ``1``."
msgstr "UART 总线 ID（0、1 或 2）。默认值为 ``1``。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBUART:4
msgid "A list or tuple of ``(rx_pin, tx_pin)``."
msgstr "包含 ``(rx_pin, tx_pin)`` 的列表或元组。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBUART:9
msgid ""
"Do not instantiate this class directly. Use :class:`CardKBUnit` with "
"``mode=CardKBUnit.CardKB_UART_MODE`` instead."
msgstr ""
"不要直接实例化此类。请改用 :class:`CardKBUnit` 并设置 "
"``mode=CardKBUnit.CardKB_UART_MODE``。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBESPNOW.tick:1 unit.cardkb.CardKBUART.tick:1
msgid "Poll the key buffer and trigger the callback if a key is available."
msgstr "轮询按键缓冲区，并在有可用按键时触发回调函数。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBUART.tick:3
msgid ""
"This method should be called periodically in the main loop to process key"
" events received via UART."
msgstr "此方法应在主循环中定期调用，以处理通过 UART 接收的按键事件。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBESPNOW:1
msgid "CardKB unit driver over ESP-NOW wireless communication."
msgstr "基于 ESP-NOW 无线通信的 CardKB 单元驱动程序。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBESPNOW:7
msgid ""
"Do not instantiate this class directly. Use :class:`CardKBUnit` with "
"``mode=CardKBUnit.CardKB_ESP_NOW_MODE`` instead."
msgstr ""
"不要直接实例化此类。请改用 :class:`CardKBUnit` 并设置 "
"``mode=CardKBUnit.CardKB_ESP_NOW_MODE``。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBESPNOW:12
msgid ""
"This class uses a broadcast MAC address (``ffffffffffff``) and fixes the "
"Wi-Fi channel to 0. Key data is received asynchronously via IRQ callback."
msgstr "此类使用广播 MAC 地址（``ffffffffffff``），并将 Wi-Fi 信道固定为 0。按键数据通过 IRQ 回调异步接收。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBESPNOW.espnow_recv_callback:1
msgid "Callback function invoked when an ESP-NOW packet is received."
msgstr "在接收到 ESP-NOW 数据包时调用的回调函数。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBESPNOW.espnow_recv_callback:3
msgid "The ESP-NOW object containing the received data."
msgstr "包含接收数据的 ESP-NOW 对象。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBESPNOW.espnow_recv_callback:4
msgid ""
"``True`` if the frame is valid and a key was appended, ``False`` "
"otherwise."
msgstr "如果帧有效并且已追加按键数据，则为 ``True``，否则为 ``False``。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBESPNOW.get_key:1
msgid "Get the next key from the buffer received via ESP-NOW."
msgstr "从通过 ESP-NOW 接收的缓冲区中获取下一个按键。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBESPNOW.get_key:3
msgid "The key tuple ``(key_id, key_state)``, or ``None`` if the buffer is empty."
msgstr "按键元组 ``(key_id, key_state)``，如果缓冲区为空则返回 ``None``。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBESPNOW.is_pressed:1
msgid "Check whether any key data is buffered from ESP-NOW."
msgstr "检查是否存在来自 ESP-NOW 的按键数据缓冲。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBESPNOW.is_pressed:3
msgid "``True`` if there is buffered key data, ``False`` otherwise."
msgstr "如果存在缓冲的按键数据则为 ``True``，否则为 ``False``。"

#: of unit.cardkb.CardKBESPNOW.tick:3
msgid ""
"This method should be called periodically in the main loop to process key"
" events received via ESP-NOW."
msgstr "此方法应在主循环中定期调用，以处理通过 ESP-NOW 接收的按键事件。"

